fishing here?","nextNodeIds":[750150603]},{"nodeId":750150603,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":209346258,"text":"Maybe I'll catch myself another travel guide...","nextNodeIds":[750150604]},{"nodeId":750150604,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":415915546,"text":"No way, Paimon vetoes that idea. Besides, there's only one Paimon, and you already caught her!","nextNodeIds":[750150605]},{"nodeId":750150605,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":1272510898,"text":"#Paimon's talking about fish-fishing! It's been a while since we last ate fish you caught and cooked yourself... Plus, it's about time you gave {REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]} a taste of your culinary wizardry!","nextNodeIds":[750150606]},{"nodeId":750150606,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21460,"speakerName":"#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}","textMapHash":440397338,"text":"Rawr!","nextNodeIds":[750150607]},{"nodeId":750150607,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":2410941866,"text":"#Hehe, it's all for poor old {REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}, y'know...","nextNodeIds":[750150608]},{"nodeId":750150608,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":748734202,"text":"Then why don't you get involved too, Paimon...","nextNodeIds":[750150609]},{"nodeId":750150609,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":132092874,"text":"How about... you do the fishing this time, Paimon?","nextNodeIds":[750150610]},{"nodeId":750150610,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":3725939018,"text":"Huh? You want P—Paimon... to do the fishing?","nextNodeIds":[750150611]},{"nodeId":750150611,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21460,"speakerName":"#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}","textMapHash":2995351506,"text":"Rawr! Rawr!","nextNodeIds":[750150612]},{"nodeId":750150612,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":354440362,"text":"#All for poor old {REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}, eh?","nextNodeIds":[750150613]},{"nodeId":750150613,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":604383570,"text":"How... How could you, catching Paimon out with her own words like that!","nextNodeIds":[750150614]},{"nodeId":750150614,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":1344402426,"text":"Ugh, alright then... But be warned, Paimon has no idea what she'll catch, if anything!","nextNodeIds":[750150615]},{"nodeId":750150615,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":1678837474,"text":"Plus, before that... Ace Angler Paimon needs a nice, tidy environment to work her magic in. What if the line gets snagged on all that junk floating around in the water?","nextNodeIds":[750150616]},{"nodeId":750150616,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":3660757074,"text":"Let's tidy up the area a bit first!","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7501506,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[{"LNHLPKELCAL":["3","133503088"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_NOTIFY_GROUP_LUA"}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_NONE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_NONE","LNHLPKELCAL":["[3_350300001:-2416.940,206.113,8137.041]","30"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_LOCATION"}}},{"subQuestId":7501502,"order":3,"stepDescription":"Clean up the nearby waters